---
// The tabs used to each be their own page — now client-side state on /applications/view (see ApplicationShell).
// Kept as a redirect so an old bookmark/link still lands on the right tab instead of 404ing. A plain
// Astro.redirect() can't read the real `id` here — this is a static build, so it only ever sees an empty query
// string at build time — hence the client-side script reading the browser's actual location instead.
---

<script>
  const params = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);
  params.set("tab", "environment");
  window.location.replace(`/applications/view?${params.toString()}`);
</script>
